      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_Rp1ar0FBDQRG3pfz42N8Rc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKd2JFcFZaRTUyT1RSUFZVYzBPRkppVDA5WlJGRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "套餐白灼虾-完全沒有味道,應是雪虾\n套餐瀨尿蝦,看似一開四,但中間身體有點兒消失了\n套戲蟹一般\n細花甲一斤14收 $379\n花螺仔一斤10收 $413\n唔去就係賺到錢,之前去洪記只選套餐好食好多.\n\nSet meal boiled prawns: Completely tasteless, definitely frozen shrimp.\nSet meal mantis shrimp: Looked like it was cut into four pieces, but the middle part of the body seemed to have disappeared.\nSet meal crab: So-so.\nSmall clams: $379 for 1 catty 14 taels.\nSmall sea snails: $413 for 1 catty 10 taels.\nSkipping a visit here is like saving money! Going to Hung Kee before and just ordering their set meal was so much better.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "套餐白灼虾-完全沒有味道,應是雪虾\n套餐瀨尿蝦,看似一開四,但中間身體有點兒消失了\n套戲蟹一般\n細花甲一斤14收 $379\n花螺仔一斤10收 $413\n唔去就係賺到錢,之前去洪記只選套餐好食好多.\n\nSet meal boiled prawns: Completely tasteless, definitely frozen shrimp.\nSet meal mantis shrimp: Looked like it was cut into four pieces, but the middle part of the body seemed to have disappeared.\nSet meal crab: So-so.\nSmall clams: $379 for 1 catty 14 taels.\nSmall sea snails: $413 for 1 catty 10 taels.\nSkipping a visit here is like saving money! Going to Hung Kee before and just ordering their set meal was so much better.",
